  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Thank You Too!**: back after 53 archived shows (685 days) [11]\n- **Oh! Sweet Nuthin'(The Velvet Underground cover)**: back after 92 archived shows (1553 days); rare: 3 archived performances [11]\n- **All Night Long (Lionel Richie cover)**: back after 105 archived shows (2083 days); rare: 4 archived performances [11]\n- **Move On Up (Curtis Mayfield cover)**: back after 53 archived shows (685 days); rare: 10 archived performances [11]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2012-09-13.MMJ-Wiltern-9-13-12** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 141 min; rated 3.22/5 by 9 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality matches the September 11 recording provided by the same uploader [5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The three-night run at the venue was described as truly unforgettable [7]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2012-09-13.MMJ-Wiltern-9-13-12**: taped by Pat Myers; transferred by Pat Myers; source: 3 mic mix 2xSennheiser MKH 8050's 1-Strasser CM 060 [1]. Also: Recorded, mastered, and posted by Pat Myers using a Schoeps/Strasser CM060 microphone [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @brahbrahbrah: [SETLIST: My Morning Jacket @ The Wiltern, Los Angeles, CA 9/12/12 - Live Music Blog](https://livemusicblog.com/setlist-my-morning-jacket-the-wiltern-los-angeles-ca-91212/) [12]",
